---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Plans" description="What comes next for Civ 1.5 Remastered.">
  <h1>Plans</h1>
  <p class="lead">Ideas for the future and ongoing roadmap.</p>

  <h2>Recently completed</h2>
  <ul class="plain-list">
    <li>
      <strong>City Projects (Wealth, Research, Food):</strong> cities can convert 50% of net shields into gold (unlocked with Banking), science (unlocked with University), or food (unlocked with Engineering).
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Upcoming features</h2>
  <ul class="plain-list">
    <li>
      <strong>Richer advisor reports:</strong> research progress, science per turn, totals of trade and food, a summary
      of the cities.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Under the hood</h2>
  <ul class="plain-list">
    <li>Replace the last reads of the game's memory by address with named fields and tables.</li>
    <li>Move the emulated runtime, clock, mouse and screens to plain .NET.</li>
    <li>In the end, run the game without the emulated processor.</li>
  </ul>
</Layout>
